1. length_squared()
T length_squared() const {
    return dot(*this);
}

2. sum()
T sum() const;

3. min() / max()
T min() const;
T max() const;

4. is_zero() / is_near_zero()
Especially useful with floating point:
bool is_zero() const;
bool is_near_zero(T epsilon) const;

5. Scalar/vector utility functions
abs()
floor()
ceil()
round()
sqrt()

could operate element-wise on mvec.

